ew":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"歐陽紇（歐陽頠子，字奉聖），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"qil_wym_gc2_AA","source_assertion_id":"a-chen017-he-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-017","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanjing-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-017-yuanjing-complete-ws1544244","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanjing-complete:p002","quote":"敬純孝有風格，幼便篤學，老而無倦。釋褐祕書郎，累遷太子舍人、洗馬、中舍人。江陵淪覆，流寓嶺表。高祖受禪，敬在廣州，依歐陽頠。及頠卒，其子紇據州，將有異志，敬累諫紇，為陳逆順之理，言甚切至，紇終不從。高宗即位，遣章昭達率红討紇，紇將敗之時，恨不納敬言。朝廷義之，其年徵為太子中庶子、通直散騎常侍。俄轉司徒左長史。尋遷左民尚書，轉都官尚書，領豫州大中正。累遷太常卿、散騎常侍、金紫光祿大夫，加特進。至德三年卒，時年七十九，贈左光祿大夫，諡曰靖德。子元友嗣。弟泌自有傳。兄子樞。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanjing-complete:p002:m0068","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-017-yuanjing-complete:p002:m0058","source_term":"其子紇"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"及頠卒，其子紇據州。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context-ws1488469","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-009","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0000","c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0004"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0000","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0004","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0004"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-chenshu-017-yuanjing-c